<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2158_8087.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freuendtlich</unclear> willig dienst zuvor, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fuersichtige</unclear>
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ehrsame</unclear> und weise, besonders liebe guete <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freuend</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Was unser burger, <persName resp="#ner">Conrad und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hanß</unclear> Jacob die
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Foelcklin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebrueder</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aines</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ft</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgeschaetzten</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgers</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Breijßig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Beckhen</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außstehenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldt=</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rests</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halben</unclear>, an uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">supplicando</unclear> gelangen, zugleich
<lb n="8"/>auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuerschrifft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bitten</unclear> lassen, das ist ab
<lb n="9"/>dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schluß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> ersehen.
<lb n="10"/>Wann dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bißhero</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear>, nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> statt gebrauch,
<lb n="11"/>in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Cession</unclear> oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guldtsgerichtssachen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsre</unclear> burger
<lb n="12"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frembde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seijen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hypothecarische</unclear> oder
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">personal</unclear>: ald <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemaine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldenvorderer</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">praelation</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halben</unclear>, ohne <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorthail</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">je</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doierung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aines</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jeden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bessern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befuegsame</unclear> oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerechtigkeit</unclear>,
<lb n="16"/>gleich gehalten worden, und noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heuetigs</unclear> tags <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">also</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>gehalten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">So</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear> wir demnach inen
<lb n="18"/>solch ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ansuechen</unclear>, nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueverwaigern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewußt</unclear>,
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonder</unclear> gelangt an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ft</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuendt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>bitten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">si</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">supplicanten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wueler=</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">konmung</unclear> ires <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">außstandts</unclear>, alle <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guenstig</unclear> guete
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befuerderung</unclear> erweisen. wie uns dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zweifelt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">si</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> sich selbsten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierzue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwondter</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2158_8088.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="24"/>sachen nach, nicht ohgenaigt sein werden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">damit</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intercession</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersprießlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genossen</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuehaben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berüemen</unclear> mögen, daß sein wir
<lb n="27"/>auff jede züetragende fell freündt. nachberlich
<lb n="28"/>züerwidern anerbiötig, göttlicher bewahr
<lb n="29"/>uns beneben anbefehlend, datt. <origDate when="1619-10-27" resp="#ner">27. octobris
<lb n="30"/>a° 1619</origDate>.
<lb n="31"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rhat der
<lb n="32"/>Statt Lindaw</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2158_8089.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2158_8090.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="33"/>Den
<lb n="34"/>fuersichtigen ehrsamen und weisen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger-
<lb n="35"/>maister und Rhat der statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>, un-
<lb n="36"/>sern besondern lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freunden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear> nach-
</p>
